role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:22:50Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "next", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:22:58Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "7.\tIn 1886, Empress Taytu Betul, the formidable wife of Emperor Menelik II, fell in love with the natural hot springs at a place called Finfinne, and she persuaded her husband to make it the new capital of his expanding empire. She named it with two words in her language meaning “new flower.” After a brief, brutal Italian occupation in the 1930s, the city emerged as a hub of pan-African politics, and now hosts the headquarters of both the African Union and the United Nations Economic Commission for Africa, earning it the nickname “the political capital of Africa.” It was also the city to which the celebrated 3.2-million-year-old _Australopithecus afarensis_ fossil “Lucy” was brought after her 1974 discovery in the country’s Afar Depression. Name the city (10 points). ‎<attached: 00137139-PHOTO-2026-04-30-09-22-58.jpg>", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:22:59Z", "username": "bijal bhatt", "text": "La paz", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:23:07Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "addis", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:23:08Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Quito", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:23:08Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "ababa", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:23:11Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "Addis Ababa", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:23:16Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "Africa hai question mein", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:23:22Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "KP: 70, Dhruva: 20, Bijal: -20, Lzafeer: 20", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:23:29Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Answers: Addis Ababa, Ethiopia", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:23:32Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Type karke rakha", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:23:44Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "the building is the headquarters of the African Union", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:24:12Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "next", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:24:20Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "10.\tThe full name of this city is Nuestra Señora de X given to it in 1548 by its Spanish founder, Captain Alonso de Mendoza, to commemorate the restoration of peace after a violent civil war among rival conquistadors. The city is famous for its Mercado de las Brujas (Witches’ Market), where Aymara stallholders sell amulets, herbs, and dried llama fetuses to be buried beneath the foundations of new houses as offerings to Pachamama, the Earth Mother. It is also famous for cholita wrestling — indigenous Aymara women in their traditional bowler hats and many-layered pollera skirts performing acrobatic lucha libre to enthusiastic local crowds. The country it serves has the unusual distinction of having two capitals: a smaller white-walled city far to the southeast is the constitutional capital, but it is in this city that the executive branch and the country’s parliament actually sit. Name the city (10 points). ‎<attached: 00137151-PHOTO-2026-04-30-09-24-20.jpg>", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:24:25Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Quito", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T16:24:30Z", "username": "bijal bhatt", "text": "La paz", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]